            "title": "Accessibility Office Update",
            "attachments": [],
            "description": "",
            "minutes": "Megan Richards, Program Manager, Accessibility, Office of the City Clerk and Sarah Beriault, Corporate Accessibility Specialist, Office of the City Clerk presented and answered questions from committee members.\nThe presentation is on file with the Office of the City Clerk.\nMembers asked questions about the senior\u2019s round table and that there is a need for more older adult programming.\nMember Furrie spoke to the Ottawa Hospital working group and how a wayfinding working group is needed.\u00a0 Member Antle agreed about the need for the Ottawa Hospital to have a working group.\u00a0 Member Antle also asked to revisit the topic of e-Scooters.\nMegan Richards will request an update from staff on the issue of E-Scooters.",
